  message: "Deliverable shipped 2026-05-24: curriculum file written to ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/curricula/rust-analyzer-validation.md. Three-tier cohort (ripgrep / firecracker / wasmtime) covering engagement sanity, mid-size workspace fidelity, and the OOM-kill stress path that WI-todon's diagnostics now make visible. Substituted firecracker + wasmtime for axum / swc / cargo (not in local pool) — wasmtime is deliberately included to validate WI-todon's SIGKILL hint + artifact-engagement-check on memory-pressured boxes. Metrics, expected directions, red-flag thresholds, and a failure-modes table tying pre-/post-WI-todon symptoms documented. Running the bakeoff is a separate user-driven step (the description scopes WI-vovad as 'add a curated cohort', not 'run the bakeoff to validation'); the bakeoff run becomes the validation signal that gates WI-burud + WI-nokoh's downstream work. Lab-notebook artifact (outside repo) so no PR was needed."  # 273c
